---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { shop } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Returns and refunds">
  <article class="page">
    <h1>Returns and refunds</h1>

    <h2>Changed your mind</h2>
    <p>
      You can cancel your order for any reason within 14 days of receiving it. Email
      <a href={`mailto:${shop.email}`}>{shop.email}</a> to tell us, then return the unopened bottle within
      14 days of that email. We refund the price and the standard postage within 14 days of getting the bottle
      back. You pay the cost of returning it.
    </p>
    <p>
      For hygiene reasons we cannot accept a bottle back once its seal is broken, unless it is faulty.
    </p>

    <h2>Broken or faulty</h2>
    <p>
      If a bottle arrives broken, or the oil is not as described, email us a photo within 7 days. We will send a
      replacement or give you a full refund, including postage. You do not need to send it back.
    </p>

    <h2>Your legal rights</h2>
    <p>These terms do not affect your rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
